{"content_hash": "08946dc96dddfbcf", "version_id": 852, "article_id": 86, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Apple puts strong noise cancelling in cheaper AirPods 5", "title_zh": "苹果把强力降噪放进更便宜的 AirPods 5", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "sspai", "source_url": "https://sspai.com/post/118122", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1662946834880-99adabd21f80?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8NHx8dGRzJTIwcmV2aWV3JTIwYXBwbGV8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5MzY3NDkzM3ww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by BoliviaInteligente on Unsplash", "author": "BoliviaInteligente", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@boliviainteligente?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/apple-logo-in-glass-cube-fN4YeoA14OI?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(104, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(142, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "a388a2c1c56a"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-03", "word_count": 152, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "Apple's new AirPods 5 bring active noise cancelling to a lower price. A review looks at the sound, the battery and the calls.", "lead_zh": "苹果新款 AirPods 5 把主动降噪带到了更低的价格。一篇评测聊了聊它的音质、续航和通话表现。", "preview": "The AirPods 5 look almost the same as the AirPods 4. They are still white and still use the same small case. But inside, Apple changed some ", "preview_zh": "AirPods 5 的外观和 AirPods 4 几乎一样。它们还是白色，也还是用那个小充电盒。但内部有些零件变了。新耳机的防水也更好，达到 IP57 级别。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 835, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/86/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 54.575, "size_bytes": 328464, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 174, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@a16dcaf/content/data/versions/852.json", "paragraphs": ["The AirPods 5 look almost the same as the AirPods 4. They are still white and still use the same small case. But inside, Apple changed some parts. The new earphones also have better water protection, at IP57 level.", "Noise cancelling is the big change. The AirPods 5 cut low sounds very well, even in trains and planes. They also feel more natural than the AirPods 4. Calls are clear, but wind noise is still a problem for now.", "There are two versions. The cheaper one costs 999 yuan and has no wireless charging. The 1149 yuan version adds wireless charging and a speaker on the case. The cheaper one also has a shorter battery life.", "The sound has strong, thick bass. Some people may like this for hip-hop and dance music. But the overall balance is not great. The reviewer says the AirPods 5 are the best half-in-ear noise-cancelling earphones today."], "paragraphs_zh": ["AirPods 5 的外观和 AirPods 4 几乎一样。它们还是白色，也还是用那个小充电盒。但内部有些零件变了。新耳机的防水也更好，达到 IP57 级别。", "降噪是最大的变化。AirPods 5 能很好地压住低频声音，在地铁和飞机上都不错。它的感觉也比 AirPods 4 更自然。通话很清楚，但风噪目前还是个问题。", "它有两个版本。便宜的一款卖 999 元，没有无线充电。1149 元的版本多了无线充电和盒身扬声器。便宜那款的续航也更短。", "声音的低频很强、很厚。喜欢嘻哈和舞曲的人可能会喜欢。但整体平衡不算好。评测者说，AirPods 5 是目前最好的半入耳降噪耳机。"], "body": "The AirPods 5 look almost the same as the AirPods 4. They are still white and still use the same small case. But inside, Apple changed some parts. The new earphones also have better water protection, at IP57 level.\n\nNoise cancelling is the big change. The AirPods 5 cut low sounds very well, even in trains and planes. They also feel more natural than the AirPods 4. Calls are clear, but wind noise is still a problem for now.\n\nThere are two versions. The cheaper one costs 999 yuan and has no wireless charging. The 1149 yuan version adds wireless charging and a speaker on the case. The cheaper one also has a shorter battery life.\n\nThe sound has strong, thick bass. Some people may like this for hip-hop and dance music. But the overall balance is not great. The reviewer says the AirPods 5 are the best half-in-ear noise-cancelling earphones today.", "body_zh": "AirPods 5 的外观和 AirPods 4 几乎一样。它们还是白色，也还是用那个小充电盒。但内部有些零件变了。新耳机的防水也更好，达到 IP57 级别。\n\n降噪是最大的变化。AirPods 5 能很好地压住低频声音，在地铁和飞机上都不错。它的感觉也比 AirPods 4 更自然。通话很清楚，但风噪目前还是个问题。\n\n它有两个版本。便宜的一款卖 999 元，没有无线充电。1149 元的版本多了无线充电和盒身扬声器。便宜那款的续航也更短。\n\n声音的低频很强、很厚。喜欢嘻哈和舞曲的人可能会喜欢。但整体平衡不算好。评测者说，AirPods 5 是目前最好的半入耳降噪耳机。", "text": "The AirPods 5 look almost the same as the AirPods 4. They are still white and still use the same small case. But inside, Apple changed some parts. The new earphones also have better water protection, at IP57 level. Noise cancelling is the big change. The AirPods 5 cut low sounds very well, even in trains and planes. They also feel more natural than the AirPods 4. Calls are clear, but wind noise is still a problem for now. There are two versions. The cheaper one costs 999 yuan and has no wireless charging. The 1149 yuan version adds wireless charging and a speaker on the case. The cheaper one also has a shorter battery life. The sound has strong, thick bass. Some people may like this for hip-hop and dance music. But the overall balance is not great. The reviewer says the AirPods 5 are the best half-in-ear noise-cancelling earphones today.", "vocab": [{"word": "noise cancelling", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "降噪", "note": "常作名词或形容词用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "earphones", "pos": "noun", "zh": "耳机", "note": "比 headphones 更常指小耳机", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "version", "pos": "noun", "zh": "版本", "note": "常与 cheap、new 等搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "case", "pos": "noun", "zh": "充电盒", "note": "这里指装耳机的盒子", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "battery", "pos": "noun", "zh": "电池；续航", "note": "battery life 指续航", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "bass", "pos": "noun", "zh": "低频；低音", "note": "音乐里的低音部分", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "balance", "pos": "noun", "zh": "平衡", "note": "这里指声音各频段的平衡", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "reviewer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "评测者", "note": "